<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#AdaptationOption> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "In human systems, the process of adjustment to actual or expected climate and its effects, in order to moderate harm or exploit beneficial opportunities. In natural systems, the process of adjustment to actual climate and its effects; human intervention may facilitate adjustment to expected climate and its effects. See also Adaptation options, Adaptive capacity and Maladaptive actions (Maladaptation)." .
